    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The paper emphasizes the importance of achieving better transparency in AI systems, particularly as they become increasingly capable and complex. The authors argue that <strong>RepE</strong> can help address many aspects of the goal of mechanistic interpretability, including understanding and controlling high-level cognition within AI systems. By providing a new approach to transparency research, RepE can contribute to the development of safer and more trustworthy AI systems.",
